WEBVTT

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.060
Shougo!

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:08.320
Good morning!

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:09.480
Good morn- Eh?

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.820
Miyabi, what's with that skirt?

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.110
If it's that short, then they'll be seen.

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.820
What will be seen?

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:17.810
What will?

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:18.700
Isn't that obvious?

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.200
Pan-

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.790
Well, anyway, that skirt is too short.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.540
But this skirt should be fine, based on the school rules.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.630
Liar!

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.250
Then measure it and check.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.340
If you don't have proof, I won't accept it.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:34.680
Fine.

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:38.030
If it's more than ten centimetres above your knee,

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:39.560
then I'll have you change into a jersey.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.310
Good grief...

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:46.530
Oh?

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:48.520
I wonder what's wrong.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:51.770
Don't move.

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:53.610
I can't measure it.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.910
Hey, Shougo.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:57.990
Do you want to see up my skirt?

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.130
There's no way I would!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:03.290
Well, you definitely are a public morals committee member.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.750
I can't let you see up my skirt.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.630
Ah, it's too bad.

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:09.850
If you weren't a public morals committee member,

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:11.750
I would be fine with showing you.

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:15.720
Miyabi...

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:18.970
Are you trying to tempt me into
quitting the public morals committee?

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:21.890
So, what will you do?

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.020
Shougo-san!

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:31.480
T-This is just...

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:33.090
As a public morals committee member,

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:34.780
I'm measuring the length of the skirt.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:37.110
Then please measure mine, too!

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:37.990
Huh?

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.780
Yours complies with the school rules, right?

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:42.580
If you don't measure it, then you wouldn't know, right?

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:43.870
What are you talking about?

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:47.290
To break the school rules, it has to be at least as short as mine.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:49.290
I see.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:50.790
Okay, how about this?

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:53.380
Hey!

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:56.590
All right, I wonder if I should lift mine a little higher?

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:59.140
Me too!

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:02.220
Why are you competing?

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.180
If you do it any more...

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:08.730
Did you see them?

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.940
You saw them, didn't you?

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:10.900
I didn't see!

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:11.770
I didn't see them!

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:13.070
What about mine?

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:15.030
You didn't look at mine, right?

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:16.320
I didn't look.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:18.780
But anyway, you're wearing shorts, Miyabi.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.780
So you were looking, you panty hunter!

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:23.410
Ah, no.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.540
What is this uproar about?

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.930
What was that uproar just now?

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.140
Well, that was... Miyabi was...

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:08.600
Konoe too, and so...

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.850
I don't want to hear your excuses!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.600
Listen.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.020
As a special public morals committee member,

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.400
you're in a position to supervise the students!

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:23.530
You have to take the initiative to keep students on the right path and make sure there is no unbecoming behaviour-

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.660
Senpai, where are you looking?

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.450
You're mistaken!

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:28.700
I wasn't looking! I wasn't looking!

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.540
It's the truth!

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.290
So how did it go, Shougo-kun?

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:38.380
Did you find out anything from checking on Kunitachi-san's background?

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:41.020
Forget checking on her background and whatnot,

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:44.010
my hands are full with public morals committee duties.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:50.140
If you have that many duties, it would certainly be impossible.

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:53.180
What if we change your location?

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:54.480
Change my location?

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:55.020
Eh?!

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:59.100
As long as you're at school, she is the vice president,

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:01.780
and you are the designated public morals committee member.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.400
Like that, it will be impossible to get her to open up her heart.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.610
However!

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.500
If you go outside the school,

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.330
then the two of you are just a man and a woman.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:12.240
This way, you can increase the level of your intimacy.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:14.570
Something is bothering me about the way you phrased that,

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:16.420
but it seems to make sense in a way.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.040
All right!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.960
I'll make the arrangements.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.970
Wait, President Tendou!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.060
It's dangerous to run like that!

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.600
Why is President Tendou with her?

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:37.090
I thought that instead of inviting her directly,

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:42.230
it would go more smoothly if President Tendou wanted to go.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:42.940
So, in other words...

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.650
"He that would the daughter win..."

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.450
That's right.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.200
What is this?

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.410
Kunitachi-san, you don't know about roller coasters?

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.460
Yes.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:59.500
This is my first time in a theme park.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:05.090
Rinka-chan's family is very strict, so it's hard to be in her household.

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:35.330
The moon is glittering...

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:36.250
Oh!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.750
Hey, are you okay?

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.670
What a rough ride that was.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:43.170
My hair got messy.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.880
What is this place?

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.430
This is...

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:55.010
A really scary haunted house.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:07:00.100
If we don't all go to the restroom, we might pee ourselves.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.280
There... There was a ghost...

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.530
Are you okay?

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.740
Ghosts don't really exist.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:10.990
Good grief...

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:13.780
Being scared like a child by that...

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:15.410
Hm?

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:32.800
This is the most popular scary attraction at this amusement park!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.680
Let's go mow down the approaching horde of zombies!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.560
If we don't defeat them, something scary will...

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:43.770
President Tendou, if you're that scared, you don't have to go.

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:45.400
I-It's okay.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.610
I'm not afraid of zombies.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:48.860
I'm not concerned.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.570
I'm not going to go.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.450
I'm not very good with corpses.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.820
I'll eat some ice cream while I'm waiting.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:56.570
Eh?

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:57.910
Ice cream?!

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:00.450
How about we go together, President Tendou?

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.290
I'll treat you to it.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:04.540
I'll have some, I'll have some!

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.090
Make sure you two come back alive!

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:10.090
You can't become zombies!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:19.140
So, I'm supposed to check into it while we're alone?

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:21.640
But, even if you say that...

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.390
Sorry for the wait.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.400
K-Kunitachi-san!

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:28.400
W-Why are you wearing a swimsuit like that?

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.440
Please don't stare at me like that!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:33.900
There weren't any rental swimsuits left apart from this one.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.460
Kunitachi-san, you're a good shot.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.090
Yeah.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:53.760
A lady must be prudent.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.560
I see, so this is what the swimsuits are for.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:02.060
This is slimy. It feels gross.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:07.020
That's payback for the slime!

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:08.310
You're good!

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.110
I did it!

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.790
Thank you.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.420
You're welcome.

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.750
We keep shooting and shooting, but they're endless.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.050
Good grief...

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.050
They really are persistent.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:37.890
You can't kick!

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.180
Shoot them!

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.310
It's a game in a theme park.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.140
Damn it!

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:48.590
What is this?

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:49.520
Power cut?

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:52.570
Kunitachi-san, are you okay?

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:53.320
No!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.110
What's wrong?!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.950
Zombie... a zombie's hand is...

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.410
Kunitachi-san, calm down!

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:01.200
It's dangerous to struggle in the dark!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.630
This is...

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:10.830
It wasn't on purpose!

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:11.920
It was an unfortunate accident!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.050
To our customers,

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:18.880
Just now, in order to find the source of a
suspicious malfunction in the main power facility,

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.930
this facility's operation has been shut down.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.540
I'm a little tired.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:53.670
The theme park isn't bad, right?

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:04.640
Hey.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:05.840
Hey!

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:07.390
Rinka-chan!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.150
Hm?

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:21.490
Kunitachi-san, let's ride that too.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:22.950
It's fine.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.950
I'll pass on a childish ride like that.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:25.550
It's all right.

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:26.450
Just come on.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.950
W-Wait!

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.900
Kunitachi-san, you like stuff like that?

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.640
N-No, I don't.

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:02.610
I thought I had seen them before somewhere, so I was having a look...

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:08.290
This is cute!

00:12:08.630 --> 00:12:10.570
Eh? What's a mosa?

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:13.710
The tail is furry. It's great, isn't it?

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:16.170
Are you buying this as a souvenir?

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:19.170
It's nice... Should I get one too?

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:22.300
If I do that, then we'd have matching ones!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.720
Right...

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:31.810
Anyway, I bought it, but what on Earth is this?

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:34.020
It's not a bear.

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:36.400
Maybe it's a raccoon?

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.690
Well, who cares.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:42.240
Somehow, hanging out with Kunitachi-san...

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:46.030
Made me feel like not checking into Kunitachi-san.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:52.700
<i>I thought I had seen them before somewhere, so I was having a look...</i>

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.010
I thought I had seen this before somewhere,

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:06.390
but isn't this Sagara-senpai's...

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.970
But... why?

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.530
Hello, Shougo-san?

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:22.900
Ah, Konoe?

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.280
Sorry for calling you so late at night.

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:26.950
Actually, I need to ask you for a favour.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.590
I told Mikadono-senpai that we were going to patrol together,

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:35.330
so where is he?

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.590
I've been waiting for you, Kunitachi-san.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:44.170
What do you mean, you've been waiting?

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:49.010
Kunitachi-san, I'm sorry, but while you were on patrol,

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:51.430
I found something in the student council room.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:52.810
What?

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:53.770
This.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.230
What is that? I have no idea.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.810
There's no point in feigning ignorance.

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:02.160
When someone claiming to be my little sister made that broadcast,

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:04.360
you weren't in the room, Kunitachi-san.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.580
And now,

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:09.200
I've found the mobile phone with the voice changer in this room.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:12.830
So, if I am the perpetrator, you want me to tell you?

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:17.710
First of all, you attached your own mobile
phone to the mike in the broadcasting room.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:21.500
After that, you used this phone's voice changer function,

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:24.210
and talked into the phone attached to the mic.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:27.550
If that's the case, then it's possible to broadcast that voice.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.760
And so what if I did do it?

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.010
Oh my.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:36.890
I thought Mikadono-senpai was a bit more clever than that.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:40.100
Didn't you buy that strap at the theme park?

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.230
No, this is...

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:46.280
It does look a bit similar, but the tail is totally different.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:51.370
Perhaps, you borrowed Tsuruma-senpai's phone,

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:54.630
and thought you could fool me-

00:14:54.630 --> 00:15:00.790
It is true that this strap is different from the one on the phone that Sagara-senpai was hiding.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:05.030
But Kunitachi-san, why do you know about that?

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:09.450
I am looking at the real thing right now, am I not?

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.930
It looks like there's no point in hiding the truth anymore.

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:19.940
As you guessed, I am the one who pretended to be your little sister and did the broadcast.

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:24.400
The other day, there was an induction course for the student council,

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.440
but the only one who came was Director Genda.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:34.070
By the way, Rinka-kun, it seems Mikadono
Kumagorou's only son is attending Miryuuin Academy.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.180
Mikadono Shougo-san, right?

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:38.080
I know him well.

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:40.710
Well, do you know about this rumour?

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:45.130
He has an unrecognised little sister in the school.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:49.800
In other words, Mikadono Kumagorou's
illegitimate child has secretly been enrolled.

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:52.090
This is the first time that I have heard about it.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.760
This is only a suggestion,

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:57.850
but can you see if you can find out about his little sister?

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:01.770
If you find something out, I would like you to inform me.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:03.850
Why would you want to know about that?

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:09.860
Soon, my company will be doing business with Mikadono Group.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:12.990
I want some leverage to use.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:16.580
So Genda wants to threaten Mikadono Group?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:23.250
My best guess is that he intends to use that information as leverage.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:27.340
To be honest, I hate helping out with a plan like this.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:30.260
But I didn't have any other choice.

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:33.010
The reason is...

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:38.260
...I have become engaged to Director Genda's son.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.200
Eh?

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.020
Engaged?

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:43.390
It's something my parents decided together.

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:46.610
I'm going to be married into Genda's family.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:49.900
I couldn't flatly refuse that favour.

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:53.530
Thinking back, I had almost given up. Then, one day,

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:56.160
I found that mobile phone in the rubbish dump.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.580
Maybe this is...

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:06.460
If I use this, I can completely become someone else.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.960
I wouldn't have the burden of a history of proper lineage,

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:12.460
and I wouldn't have to get married to protect my family's honour.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:13.800
Another me.

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:17.840
By the time I realised it,

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:20.640
I had secretly taken the mobile phone that I found back home.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:24.810
The time drew near right before my eyes during the inspection of the board of directors.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:28.310
It was like the other me was whispering into my ear.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.650
Then suddenly, I came up with that plan.

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:33.650
Then...

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:37.030
However, don't think I'm somebody you know.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:40.960
The next time you try to search for me,

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:44.660
all the secrets I hold will be found out.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:48.670
So you weren't saying that to me, but to Genda?

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:52.880
You have to be careful of your surroundings, okay?

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:57.090
So, "be careful of your surroundings"-

00:17:57.090 --> 00:18:01.180
You were trying to somehow warn me that Genda was trying to get to me?

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:03.970
Yes.

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:06.430
That's why I had you become a public morals committee member.

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:09.440
If you did that, it would straighten you out.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.980
I thought it would get rid of the leverage, too.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.650
Kunitachi-san, I'm sorry.

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:17.610
You're going through all of this to help me,

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:18.740
but I didn't realise at all.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:22.490
There's no need for you to apologise.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:25.120
After all, you're a victim.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:27.180
I should be sorry because being tied to family and honour,

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:31.150
I couldn't refuse such a wicked request.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:36.260
Kunitachi-san, can't you break off the engagement?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.130
That's impossible.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:42.390
That is a promise made by my parents, so it has already been decided.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:45.850
Besides, the discussions have already moved forward.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.270
Now, it's already...

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:08.120
Kunitachi-san, become my lover!

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:13.840
Well, we'll pretend to be lovers, but...

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:18.130
So that the engagement would be cancelled, right?

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:21.050
You don't have to get married when you don't want to!

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.930
Even if it's for your family, that kind of thing is wrong!

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.890
I'm only saying this because I want to help you.

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:34.980
This might sound weird, but I want to save you.

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:42.820
After finding out about your bitter and painful thoughts,

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.670
I can no longer leave you alone.

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:45.700
That's why, I...

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.870
Senpai, please close your eyes.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:48.620
Eh?

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:49.830
Just do it. Hurry up.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.270
It's fine now.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:21.820
I can't tell a lie to deceive my own family.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:23.880
That's why...

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:25.760
That's why, Senpai,

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:29.200
if we are going to be lovers, then let's be real lovers!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:33.160
W-Wait! Kunitachi-san-

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.630
Senpai...

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.930
You'll take responsibility, right?

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:05.780
Oh yeah, why did you suddenly stop being a special high class public morals committee member?

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:07.280
Eh?

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:09.700
Well, that's...

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.450
It doesn't matter what the reason is.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:14.080
Anyway, I'm relieved that you stopped.

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:17.960
Eh?

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.150
Here, Senpai.

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:22.590
Please eat up!

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:23.470
Eh?

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:27.180
But, why...

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:30.180
How could you ask why...?

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:32.770
I'm your lover after all!

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:33.220
Huh?

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:36.850
It's natural for me to make you lunch.

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:38.440
Lover?!

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:40.820
That's only for you to cancel your engagement.

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:41.360
Right.

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:45.150
Thanks to you, I quietly cancelled the engagement.

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:47.490
It seems like my father has taken a liking to you.

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:51.160
It's definitely a relationship as a preamble to marriage.

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:52.330
Eh?!

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:59.420
Shougo!

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:02.050
What on Earth is going on?!

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:03.980
Calm down!

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:05.990
There's a reason for everything!

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:24.610
The love that ran away is searching for Eden

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:36.200
Despite losing my bearings, I understood the weight I felt from you

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:41.840
We felt it on that summer day

00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:47.920
Do you regret our meeting because of these painful lies?

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:53.930
Are you saying it was only painful?

00:22:53.930 --> 00:23:01.560
Sweep away the coming tomorrow with those gentle hands

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:07.650
A promise forever from bygone days

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:14.410
We will certainly be together, because I still believe in you

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:20.420
My pounding heart won't stop now

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:26.500
It has finally begun, that lovely thing

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:38.220
To a dazzling world of bewilderment with my heavenly lover

00:23:40.140 --> 00:23:43.690
Everyone, it's time for the customary Shiga-san check!

00:23:43.690 --> 00:23:45.420
First up is Kashinoki-san.

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:49.110
1 "pia"...

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:52.350
Next up is Tsuruma-senpai's mucus membrane.

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:52.990
Yes.

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:56.740
There were 3 "pia"s.

00:23:56.740 --> 00:23:58.470
Eh, even though it's in my mouth?

00:23:58.470 --> 00:24:01.410
Okay, now it's time for my sexy preview.

00:24:01.410 --> 00:24:06.070
Next time, episode 9: Descent! Little Sister Warning!!

00:24:06.070 --> 00:24:07.010
You get the participation prize.

00:24:07.010 --> 00:24:08.330
What?!
